4. `animation`: Primary full-body 2-bone IK pose or trick from:
   - Greeting/Positive: "wave", "nod", "peace", "cheer", "bow", "hug_attempt"
   - Attitude/Personality: "confident", "smug_pose", "shy", "shrug", "refuse"
